<Policy
  title="Terms of Use | India Visit"
  heading="Terms of use"
  description="The terms on which India Visit provides this website and the information published on it."
  path="/terms/"
>
  <h2 id="about">About these terms</h2>
  <p>
    These govern your use of this website. They are separate from the terms of
    any journey you book with us, which are set out when you book, and from the
    operator terms that apply to luxury-train bookings.
  </p>

  <h2 id="accuracy">Accuracy of what is published</h2>
  <p>
    Itineraries on this site are starting points. Timings, properties and
    inclusions are indicative until confirmed in writing for your dates, and
    prices are never published for operator-run journeys.
  </p>

  <h2 id="ip">Intellectual property</h2>
  <p>Ownership of the text, photography and marks on this site.</p>

  <h2 id="liability">Liability</h2>
  <p>To be settled by the client's legal adviser.</p>

  <h2 id="law">Governing law</h2>
  <p>To be confirmed, along with the jurisdiction for any dispute.</p>
</Policy>
